    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret biolab run by a decaying utopian regime. A failed experiment. A nightmare set free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, hunt, and evolve as you escape a brutal research facility in this  reverse horror action roguelike. Mutate with every run, shaping your own perfect monstrosity. Will you outsmart your captors \u2014 or reduce them to meat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect (So Far)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth or Slaughter</strong> \u2013 Skulk in the shadows or turn the halls into a slaughterhouse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Mutation</strong> \u2013 Evolve grotesque new abilities on every run, warping your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Escapes</strong> \u2013 No two attempts are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Horror</strong> \u2013 Piece together the dark secrets of the facility\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Then There Are the Cats</strong> \u2013 Mysterious, indifferent\u2026 possibly plotting something. We\u2019re not sure yet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret biolab run by a decaying utopian regime. A failed experiment. A nightmare set free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, hunt, and evolve as you escape a brutal research facility in this  reverse horror action roguelike. Mutate with every run, shaping your own perfect monstrosity. Will you outsmart your captors \u2014 or reduce them to meat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect (So Far)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth or Slaughter</strong> \u2013 Skulk in the shadows or turn the halls into a slaughterhouse. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Mutation</strong> \u2013 Evolve grotesque new abilities on every run, warping your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Escapes</strong> \u2013 No two attempts are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Horror</strong> \u2013 Piece together the dark secrets of the facility\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Then There Are the Cats</strong> \u2013 Mysterious, indifferent\u2026 possibly plotting something. We\u2019re not sure yet.</p>",
