        "notes": "Players take on the role of a monster with the ability to kill humans, resulting in pixelated yet semi-realistic gore. Blood and body parts are visibly scattered upon impact, and the player can consume flesh from fallen victims. The game features a retro-style graphics aesthetic, with intentionally pixelated visuals, but the depictions of violence and gore may still be disturbing to some players."
